This is a desktop Windows (.NET + WebView2) port of the Android application
MrOpenVPN Client: https://github.com/byMr712/MrOpenVPNClient

Android original
================
MrOpenVPN Client for Android is a fork of ics-openvpn v0.7.64.
    Original core: Arne Schwabe — https://github.com/schwabe/ics-openvpn
    Custom shell:  Kotlin app module (com.mropenvpn.client) by Mr712
    License: GNU GPL v3 (same as this Windows port)
    Android repo: https://github.com/byMr712/MrOpenVPNClient

The Windows port is an independent native .NET + WebView2 reimplementation of the same
user interface and behaviour. It does not contain Android / Kotlin code.

Bundled third-party components (bin/)
====================================
The `bin/` folder of this project contains binaries from the official
OpenVPN for Windows distribution (build.openvpn.net):

| Component                    | Version       | License        | File(s) in licenses/   |
|------------------------------|---------------|----------------|------------------------|
| OpenVPN (openvpn.exe)        | 2.6.13        | GPL-2.0 + exceptions | LICENSE-OPENVPN.txt, LICENSE-GPL-2.0.txt |
| OpenSSL (libcrypto-3-x64.dll, libssl-3-x64.dll) | 3.4.0 | Apache-2.0 | LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt |
| pkcs11-helper (libpkcs11-helper-1.dll) | 1.0.0 | GPL-2.0-or-later | LICENSE-PKCS11HELPER.txt, LICENSE-GPL-2.0.txt |
| Microsoft VC++ runtime (vcruntime140.dll) | 14.29.30037.0 | Microsoft license terms | LICENSE-VCRUNTIME.txt |
| WireGuard Wintun (wintun.dll) | 0.14.1      | GPL-2.0        | LICENSE-WINTUN.txt, LICENSE-GPL-2.0.txt |

